Refocus the SPA on the chore-payout loop and ship second-user fixes.

Replace the kid sign-in's family-name search with a 6-digit pairing-code
form. Replace the family-canvas Calendar+Whiteboards+Lists hybrid with a
chore-only Schedule desktop sourced from the new schedule endpoint.

Add an OnboardWizard at /onboard that gates new families through payout-day
selection, kid creation, a five-chore Starter Pack, and a tablet-pairing
step before they ever see the empty Kanban. The route is enforced via the
parent principal's familyOnboardingCompletedAt field.

On the kid-principal tablet, show pending cards in a yellow waiting-state
and surface a "Get a parent to approve" CTA that opens a ParentSignInSheet
calling /api/auth/elevate. Elevation grants a 30-minute idle window for
the parent's writes, then the device falls back to the kid principal.

Add AdminNotifications and AdminFamily-Paired-Devices panels, a sticky
"pair a kitchen tablet" reminder above the Kanban (dismissable only from
admin), and a single PlanUpsellSheet that's the only paywall in the
product. Beat-stage the TV-mode champion-of-the-week ceremony so the
dance art enters cleanly, gated by a per-family tvCelebrationSound toggle.

Extract PinPad to a shared component so the wizard and KidPinScreen share
one implementation. Drop the 24-chore default seed and the signup gender
picker; gender is asked later, in context.
